<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Edus — Bursary Playbook</title>
<style>
    @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 8mm 9mm 16mm 9mm; }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif;
        font-size: 9.4pt;
        line-height: 1.42;
        color: #111827;
    }

    /* ── Cover ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .cover { page-break-after: always; }

    .cover-band { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: #16223C; color: #ffffff; }
    .cover-band td { padding: 12pt 14pt; vertical-align: bottom; }
    .brand-cell { width: 62%; }
    .doc-cell { text-align: right; }

    .wordmark {
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif;
        font-size: 26pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: -0.6pt;
        color: #ffffff;
        line-height: 1;
    }
    .wordmark .dot { color: #2563EB; }
    .tagline {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 4pt;
        font-size: 8pt;
        color: #B8C4D8;
        letter-spacing: .05em;
    }

    .doc-type {
        display: block;
        font-size: 8pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.2pt;
        color: #C3CFE2;
    }
    .doc-version {
        display: block;
        margin-top: 3pt;
        font-size: 10pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #ffffff;
    }

    .cover-body { padding: 18pt 14pt 0; }

    .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 4pt;
        font-size: 8pt;
        font-weight: bold;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1.2pt;
        color: #2563EB;
    }

    h1.cover-title {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif;
        font-size: 30pt;
        line-height: 1.05;
        color: #16223C;
    }

    .cover-sub {
        margin: 7pt 0 12pt;
        font-size: 12pt;
        line-height: 1.4;
        color: #374151;
    }

    table.meta {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 8pt 0 12pt;
        background: #F9FAFB;
        border-top: .8pt solid #D1D5DB;
        border-bottom: .8pt solid #D1D5DB;
    }
    table.meta td {
        padding: 5pt 7pt;
        vertical-align: top;
        border-left: .6pt solid #E5E7EB;
    }
    table.meta td:first-child { border-left: 0; }

    .label {
        display: block;
        font-size: 7pt;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: .5pt;
        color: #6B7280;
        margin-bottom: 1pt;
    }
    .value { font-size: 9.2pt; font-weight: bold; }

    .cover-note {
        background: #F9FAFB;
        border-left: 2.5pt solid #2563EB;
        padding: 6pt 8pt;
        margin: 10pt 0 12pt;
        font-size: 9pt;
    }
    .cover-note strong { color: #16223C; }

    .cover-section {
        margin: 12pt 0 6pt;
        padding-bottom: 2pt;
        font-size: 11pt;
        color: #16223C;
        border-bottom: .8pt solid #D1D5DB;
    }

    table.toc { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 8.9pt; }
    table.toc td { padding: 2.1pt 4pt; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: .5pt solid #E5E7EB; }
    table.toc td.num { width: 22pt; text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #2563EB; }

    .cover-foot {
        margin-top: 16pt;
        padding-top: 3pt;
        border-top: .5pt solid #E5E7EB;
        font-size: 7.4pt;
        color: #6B7280;
    }

    /* ── Contents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .contents { padding-top: 2pt; }
    .contents-title {
        margin: 0 0 2pt;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif;
        font-size: 20pt;
        color: #16223C;
    }
    .contents-note { margin: 0 0 10pt; font-size: 9pt; color: #6B7280; }

    /* ── Body ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    h1 {
        margin: 0 0 8pt;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif;
        font-size: 20pt;
        color: #16223C;
    }

    h2 {
        margin: 14pt 0 6pt;
        padding-bottom: 3pt;
        font-family: "DejaVu Serif", serif;
        font-size: 15pt;
        color: #16223C;
        border-bottom: 1.6pt solid #2563EB;
        page-break-after: avoid;
    }

    h2.part { page-break-before: always; }

    h3 {
        margin: 10pt 0 4pt;
        font-size: 11pt;
        color: #16223C;
        page-break-after: avoid;
    }

    h4 {
        margin: 8pt 0 3pt;
        font-size: 10pt;
        color: #16223C;
        page-break-after: avoid;
    }

    p { margin: 0 0 5pt; }
    strong { color: #111827; }

    code {
        font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 8pt;
        background: #F3F4F6;
        padding: 0 1pt;
    }

    pre.code {
        margin: 6pt 0;
        padding: 5pt 6pt;
        background: #F3F4F6;
        border: .6pt solid #D1D5DB;
        font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace;
        font-size: 7.4pt;
        line-height: 1.35;
        white-space: pre-wrap;
        word-wrap: break-word;
    }

    blockquote {
        margin: 6pt 0;
        padding: 5pt 7pt;
        background: #F9FAFB;
        border-left: 2.5pt solid #2563EB;
        font-size: 9pt;
    }
    blockquote p { margin: 0; }

    hr { border: 0; border-top: .6pt solid #D1D5DB; margin: 9pt 0; }

    ul, ol { margin: 3pt 0 6pt 16pt; padding: 0; }
    li { margin: 0 0 2pt; }
    li > ul, li > ol { margin: 2pt 0 2pt 12pt; }
    .checkbox { font-family: "DejaVu Sans Mono", monospace; color: #2563EB; }

    table.grid {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin: 6pt 0 8pt;
        font-size: 8.2pt;
        table-layout: auto;
    }
    table.grid th {
        padding: 2.6pt 3pt;
        background: #F3F4F6;
        border: .6pt solid #D1D5DB;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 7.6pt;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: .2pt;
        color: #374151;
    }
    table.grid td {
        padding: 2.2pt 3pt;
        border: .6pt solid #E5E7EB;
        vertical-align: top;
        word-wrap: break-word;
    }
    table.grid tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #FAFAFA; }
    table.grid th.num, table.grid td.num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
    table.grid th.center, table.grid td.center { text-align: center; }
    table.grid tr { page-break-inside: avoid; }
    thead { display: table-header-group; }

    /* ── Page footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .page-footer {
        position: fixed;
        left: 0;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 5mm;
        padding: 2pt 9mm 0;
        border-top: .5pt solid #E5E7EB;
        font-size: 7pt;
        color: #6B7280;
        text-align: center;
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{# ── Cover ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<div class="cover">
    <table class="cover-band">
        <tr>
            <td class="brand-cell">
                <span class="wordmark">Edus<span class="dot">.</span></span>
                <span class="tagline">The school operating system</span>
            </td>
            <td class="doc-cell">
                <span class="doc-type">Bursary playbook</span>
                <span class="doc-version">Version 1.0</span>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="cover-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Bursary operations · training playbook</p>
        <h1 class="cover-title">Bursary Playbook</h1>
        <p class="cover-sub">
            A practical guide to running the bursary desk in Edus — from finding a
            family and keeping parent contacts correct, to importing fees already
            collected, taking money, and closing the day.
        </p>

        <table class="meta">
            <tr>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">For</span>
                    <span class="value">Bursary, accounts office and school-fee staff</span>
                </td>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">Role</span>
                    <span class="value">ROLE_BURSAR</span>
                </td>
                <td>
                    <span class="label">Version</span>
                    <span class="value">1.0 · 14 November 2026</span>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <div class="cover-note">
            <strong>How to use this playbook.</strong> Read Part 1 before your first
            login. Work through Parts 2–9 with a trainer on a training tenant, never
            on the live school database. Keep Part 15 at the desk for daily reference.
            The exercises in Part 16 are the sign-off.
        </div>

        <h2 class="cover-section">What is inside</h2>

        <table class="toc">
            {% for item in contents %}
                <tr>
                    <td class="num">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                    <td>{{ item }}</td>
                </tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </table>

        <p class="cover-foot">
            This playbook includes the 14 November 2026 release: Fees Import, family
            linking, parent titles ALH/HAJ/MAL, Student Type, phone search and the
            mobile layouts. It is internal training material, not a school-issued
            certificate or financial document.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

{# ── Contents ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
<div class="contents">
    <h2 class="contents-title">Contents</h2>
    <p class="contents-note">
        {{ contents|length }} sections. Each part explains what the screen is for,
        then the steps, then what success looks like.
    </p>

    <table class="toc">
        {% for item in contents %}
            <tr>
                <td class="num">{{ loop.index }}</td>
                <td>{{ item }}</td>
            </tr>
        {% endfor %}
    </table>
</div>

{# ── Body ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── #}
{{ body|raw }}

<div class="page-footer">
    Edus · Bursary Playbook · v1.0 · 14 November 2026 · Internal training material
</div>

</body>
</html>
